Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ha@gmail.com",
  "passwordHash": "1!1zAmAlEK" 
}



### 5. 
GET {{ArtifactsAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Artifacts
Authorization: Bearer {{EngineerToken}}
Accept: application/json





### Create a New Post (With Coordinates)
POST {{ArtifactsAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Posts/create
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{EngineerToken}}

{
  "title": " Scan",
  "description": "A detailed 3D scan of the Sphinx",
  "coverPhoto": "https://url.com/cover.jpg",
  "model3D": "https://url.com/model.glb",
  "coordinates": [
    {
      "title": "Head Position",
      "description": "Right eye area",
      "x": 29.9753,
      "y": 31.1308
    },
    {
      "title": "Base Position",
      "description": "Left paw area",
      "x": 29.9750,
      "y": 31.1305
    }
  ]
}

### Get All Posts
GET {{ArtifactsAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Posts
Accept: application/json


### 1. Follow / Unfollow User (Put the target User ID in URL)
POST {{ArtifactsAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/users/5/follow
Authorization: Bearer {{EngineerToken}}

### 2. Get User Profile with Followers & Following count
GET {{ArtifactsAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/users/5/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{EngineerToken}}

### 3. Record a View for a Post
POST {{ArtifactsAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Posts/1/view
Authorization: Bearer {{EngineerToken}}

### 4. Get Post Details (Now includes ViewsCount and LikesCount)
GET {{ArtifactsAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Posts/1
Authorization: Bearer {{EngineerToken}}

###

PUT {{ArtifactsAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/select-engineer/1
Authorization: Bearer {{AdminToken}}
###
PUT {{ArtifactsAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/select-engineer/by-email?email=hossam@engineer.com
Authorization: Bearer {{AdminToken}}

### ==========================================
### 1. Posts Endpoints (Edit & Delete)
### ==========================================

### Edit Post (Owner Only)
PUT {{ArtifactsAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Posts/edit/1
Authorization: Bearer {{EngineerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated 3D Artifact",
  "description": "This description was updated successfully via the new Edit endpoint."
}

### Delete Post (Owner OR Admin)
DELETE {{ArtifactsAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Posts/delete/1
Authorization: Bearer {{AdminToken}} 
# تقدر تبدل الـ AdminToken بـ EngineerToken وتجرب تمسح بوست مش بتاعك عشان تتأكد إنه هيرفض


### ==========================================
### 2. Likes & Bookmarks Endpoints
### ==========================================

### Toggle Like (Add / Remove Like)
POST {{ArtifactsAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Posts/8/like
Authorization: Bearer {{EngineerToken}}

### Toggle Bookmark (Add / Remove Bookmark)
POST {{ArtifactsAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Posts/6/bookmark
Authorization: Bearer {{EngineerToken}}


### ==========================================
### 3. Admin Control Endpoints (By Email)
### ==========================================

### Revoke Engineer Permission (Admin Only)
PUT {{ArtifactsAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/revoke-engineer/by-email?email=hossam@engineer.com
Authorization: Bearer {{AdminToken}}

### Delete User Entirely (Admin Only)
DELETE {{ArtifactsAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/delete-user/by-email?email=test@example.com
Authorization: Bearer {{AdminToken}}

